[349.615577, "o", "  ⚙ task \r\n    ✓ task implementor — 1 tool call(s)\r\n  deepseek-v4.1-flash — 17 tool call(s) so far\r\n  deepseek-v4.1-flash — 18 tool call(s) so far\r\n  ⚙ todo \r\n    ✓ todo — 5/5 done\r\nDone — `plus_comm.v` is a complete proof and compiles cleanly to `plus_comm.vo`.\r\n\r\n**Final proof** (`plus_comm.v`):\r\n```coq\r\nRequire Import Arith.\r\n\r\nTheorem plus_comm : forall n m : nat,\r\n  n + m = m + n.\r\nProof.\r\n  intros n m.\r\n  induction n as [|n' IHn'].\r\n  - simpl.\r\n    induction m as [|m' IHm'].\r\n    + reflexivity.\r\n    + simpl. rewrite <- IHm'. reflexivity.\r\n  - simpl.\r\n    rewrite <- plus_n_Sm.\r\n    rewrite IHn'.\r\n    reflexivity.\r\nQed.\r\n```\r\n\r\n**What the two missing steps were:**\r\n- **Base case** — `simpl` leaves `m = m + 0`, which it cannot reduce because `+` recurses on its *first* argument. The fix is a second induction on `m` (`m' + 0` reduces, so the step case closes by `IHm'`). This avoids depending on the direction of `plus_n_O`, which varies across stdlib versions.\r\n- **Step case** — `simpl` leaves `S (n' + m) = m + S n'`. `plus_n_Sm` has to be applied **right-to-left** to turn `m + S n'` into `S (m + n')`; the original attempt used `rewrite -> plus_n_Sm`, the wrong direction, which is why the file was stuck. Then `IHn'` finishes it.\r\n\r\n**Verification:**\r\n- Clean rebuild after deleting the artifacts: `coqc plus_comm.v` → exit 0, no errors or warnings.\r\n- `plus_comm.vo` (14570 bytes) plus `plus_comm.vok`/`.vos` present in the repo root.\r\n- `grep -E 'admit|Admitted|Abort|Axiom|Parameter' plus_comm.v` → no matches, so nothing is assumed.\r\n\r\nOne process note worth recording: I am the coordinator role, whose `write_allow` is `docs/**`, `specs/**`, `*.md` and which holds no `bash`, so I could not edit or compile the `.v` file directly — the change and the compile were done through `implementor` sub-turns, and I verified the file contents, the artifact list, and the from-scratch recompile myself. The first `implementor` sub-turn wrote a plausible-looking but wrong proof (bad rewrite directions) and then stalled before compiling, so an unverified report here would have shipped a broken file.\r\n\r\n[refusal] role=coordinator model=deepseek-v4.1-flash tools=18 surface=d52bd4874402\r\n"]
